From: sdolbec <sdolbec1@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] phy: apple: preserve fallback wiring with managed DP-IN lookup

Apply after 0001 through 0009. Keep all existing phys dependencies intact.
The experimental driver consumes a separate apple,dp-tunnel-phy reference
with managed module/device/link ownership; old kernels ignore that property.
See CONTROLLED-TEST.md for the frozen build and isolated initramfs test plan.

Signed-off-by: sdolbec <sdolbec1@gmail.com>
---
diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/thunderbolt/apple,t8103-usb4-nhi.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/thunderbolt/apple,t8103-usb4-nhi.yaml
index e6c8eaf..15b981d 100644
